OL,3,GNEWSASinkhole closes coast road for up
OL,4,Ato four weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA coastal road on the west of the Isle
OL,7,Fof Man has been closed for up to four
OL,8,Fweeks due to a sink hole with drivers
OL,9,F"strongly" warned to avoid the
OL,10,F"unstable" area.
OL,12,FThe A27 Road between Glen Maye and
OL,13,FDalby was partly shut on Tuesday
OL,14,Fevening after part of the seaward
OL,15,Fcarriageway collapsed.
OL,17,FAn inspection by engineers from the
OL,18,FDepartment of Infrastructure (DOI)
OL,19,Ffound that the roadside retaining wall
OL,20,Fhad also been undermined creating a
OL,21,F"serious risk to highway users".
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
