OL,3,GNEWSASinkhole closes coast road for up
OL,4,Ato four weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlthough the surface hole was about 5ft
OL,7,Fsq (0.4m sq), the void underneath
OL,8,Fextended to the centre of the
OL,9,Fcarriageway and was up to 10ft (3m)
OL,10,Fdeep, the DOI said.
